# External channels

- Inherit `RechargeChannelsBaseCore` / `WithdrawChannelsBaseCore` (or closest sibling)
- Models under `ChannelModels/Recharge` or `ChannelModels/Withdraw`
- **Must** register in `ChannelCoreKnownImplementations`
- Keep `SupplierCode` aligned with implementation class name mapping
- Do not write production `hx_supplier` secrets into the repo
